  "question": {
    "text": "Experimental investigations show that the intensity of solar radiation is maximum for a wavelength $480 \\mathrm{~nm}$ in the visible region. Estimate the surface temperature of sun. Given Wein's constant $b=2.88 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{mK}$."
  },
